      "diff": "@@ -50,6 +50,11 @@ The following features are either new or have been significantly updated since v\n   The macOS icon now supports Liquid Glass and is sized according to Apple's specifications on older macOS versions.\n   wsbuglink:18131[]\n \n+* The RTP Player now supports AMR-WB encoded audio.\n+\n+* The protocol dissection API has been updated to more safely handle packet data offsets and lengths.\n+  See the <<Major API Changes>> section below for details.\n+\n // === Removed Features and Support\n \n // === Removed Dissectors\n",
